What does this program print?

```php
<?php
enum Light
{
    case Red;
    case Amber;
    case Green;

    public function next(): self
    {
        return match ($this) {
            self::Red => self::Green,
            self::Green => self::Amber,
            self::Amber => self::Red,
        };
    }
}
$light = Light::Red;
for ($i = 0; $i < 4; $i++) {
    $light = $light->next();
}
echo $light->name, "\n";
```

